    "body": "This specifies existing webkit behavior but I'm not sure it's the desirable one. It means that when you `window.open()` a popup it starts as insecure, and then becomes \"secure\" once it navigates. \r\n\r\nThis seems to have a history. See #6369, w3c/webappsec-secure-contexts#27.",
